GravityCategory<public><localizes>:message = "Gravity"
GravityRadiusToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Radius the pull reaches (centimeters). Strongest at the center, 0 at this distance."
GravityStrengthToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Pull strength at the center (centimeters per second squared; the speed toward the center grows by this much every second). Players whose movement is being controlled (swinging, flying with a jetpack, etc.) are not pulled."
GravityDurationToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Time until a placed gravity point disappears (seconds). Using it again while placed removes it at once."
GravityPlaceDistanceToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "How many centimeters ahead of the reticle to place it. If something is in the way, it is placed in front of it."
GravityWellPrefabToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "The prefab (with a mesh etc.) used as the look of a placed point. Each placement creates one and adds gravity. With the default entity, the point has no visual."
GravityPlaceActionToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "The input (Input Action) that places a gravity point (or removes it while placed). The default is WeaponPrimary (the attack button)."
GravityPlaceMappingToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "The key mapping (Input Mapping) enabled while granted. Pick one that contains the input above. The default is RangedWeaponMapping (weapon controls)."
GravityRemoveMappingToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, removes the key mapping above when revoked (for an item, when unequipped). Turn it on only when you picked a mapping dedicated to this ability. With the default RangedWeaponMapping, turning it on also disables the weapon controls."
GravityInputCategory<public><localizes>:message = "Input"
